#!/usr/local/bin/dyalogscript
⍝ Headless match: depth-4 alpha-beta (4 _AB) against Greedy over the first N tuning openings (default 20).
⍝ Run from the project root: ./tools/match.apls [N]. Needs no Link: Harness.Data finds src/data.dcf from the fixed file.
z←{2⎕FIX'file://',(⊃1⎕NPARTS''),'src/',⍵,'.apln'}¨'Othello' 'Games' 'Harness'
a←2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
n←{0=≢⍵:20 ⋄ ⊃⊃(//)⎕VFI⊃⌽⍵}a/⍨∧/¨a∊¨⊂⎕D
⎕←#.Harness.{1 Report((4 gm._AB)_Match_ Greedy)⍵↑Data'openTune'}n
